        },
        {
          "source": "https://cardanofoundation.org/blog/impacts-cardano-treasury-mechanism",
          "thread": "Treasury and governance disputes",
          "why": "The $600M ADA misconduct allegation against Hoskinson, the cancelled 2026 summit after DRep quorum failed, and the scaled-back treasury proposal all signal that Cardano's on-chain governance experiment is generating more controversy than confidence."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "ETF and institutional filing momentum",
          "why": "Grayscale's Delaware entity registrations, CME futures covering 75% of market cap, and leveraged ETF launches signal Wall Street appetite, pulling in readers tracking whether institutional capital will validate or bypass ADA."
